{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853600/extras/b509abf05f91c106eca3feccb047f358.poster.avif?t=1753433457\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853600/extras/b509abf05f91c106eca3feccb047f358.webm?t=1753433457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>Corner Shop: Nightshift Demo drops you into your first nights alone in an uncanny convenience store. This is not just a job. It is the beginning of a nightmare experience built around grind, anxiety, and isolation. This short, standalone section introduces the game\u2019s narrative style, core mechanics, and unsettling atmosphere. The store never sleeps. And neither will you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES INCLUDED IN THE DEMO</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 Approx. 45\u201365 minutes of single-player content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 First-person shop simulator with psychological horror elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 Progressive visual and audio distortions that unsettle the night shift routine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 Core gameplay systems: using a phone, ordering and unpacking stock, customer service, ID checks, scanning products, cleaning the shop, monitoring CCTV</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 English voice acting and user interface</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 Full keyboard and controller support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853600/extras/20921d5dae7999c9cfd0fde7d2e3cbdd.poster.avif?t=1753433457\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853600/extras/20921d5dae7999c9cfd0fde7d2e3cbdd.webm?t=1753433457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>Strange things happen on night shifts. The cameras keep recording some movements. A voice whispers between the aisles. Nothing feels quite real. This is your first week on the job. Let\u2019s see if you can finish it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853600/extras/54fb35377bb2f69a5a7f8599dc3a6f70.poster.avif?t=1753433457\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853600/extras/54fb35377bb2f69a5a7f8599dc3a6f70.webm?t=1753433457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>You step into the story of Adam Callahan, a man trying to rebuild his life, one shift at a time. The night job offers a chance to prove he can take back control, to show he\u2019s ready. But the store is not empty. Ghosts of the past linger between the aisles, and what begins as work soon becomes a confrontation with memory. But the worst is still to come\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853600/extras/c144f16dad5146eeada05c03530fc440.poster.avif?t=1753433457\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853600/extras/c144f16dad5146eeada05c03530fc440.webm?t=1753433457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>Running a store at night means doing everything yourself. From unpacking boxes to facing customers, every step demands focus. Tasks pile up quickly, time runs short, and no one is coming to help. Even if you are screaming for one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3853600?t=1753433457","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853600/dfd7a5032cf059f4e9c62d5bfbc95fbcd3fb5308/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753433457","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853600/dbf7907ff464f927b71bd2666ae80030cb41b1f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753433457","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853600/dbf7907ff464f927b71bd2666ae80030cb41b1f6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753433457","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853600/extras/b509abf05f91c106eca3feccb047f358.poster.avif?t=1753433457\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853600/extras/b509abf05f91c106eca3feccb047f358.webm?t=1753433457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>Corner Shop: Nightshift Demo drops you into your first nights alone in an uncanny convenience store. This is not just a job. It is the beginning of a nightmare experience built around grind, anxiety, and isolation. This short, standalone section introduces the game\u2019s narrative style, core mechanics, and unsettling atmosphere. The store never sleeps. And neither will you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES INCLUDED IN THE DEMO</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 Approx. 45\u201365 minutes of single-player content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 First-person shop simulator with psychological horror elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 Progressive visual and audio distortions that unsettle the night shift routine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 Core gameplay systems: using a phone, ordering and unpacking stock, customer service, ID checks, scanning products, cleaning the shop, monitoring CCTV</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 English voice acting and user interface</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 Full keyboard and controller support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853600/extras/20921d5dae7999c9cfd0fde7d2e3cbdd.poster.avif?t=1753433457\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853600/extras/20921d5dae7999c9cfd0fde7d2e3cbdd.webm?t=1753433457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>Strange things happen on night shifts. The cameras keep recording some movements. A voice whispers between the aisles. Nothing feels quite real. This is your first week on the job. Let\u2019s see if you can finish it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853600/extras/54fb35377bb2f69a5a7f8599dc3a6f70.poster.avif?t=1753433457\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853600/extras/54fb35377bb2f69a5a7f8599dc3a6f70.webm?t=1753433457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>You step into the story of Adam Callahan, a man trying to rebuild his life, one shift at a time. The night job offers a chance to prove he can take back control, to show he\u2019s ready. But the store is not empty. Ghosts of the past linger between the aisles, and what begins as work soon becomes a confrontation with memory. But the worst is still to come\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" au